func (a *App) handleWorkerAvailability(_ http.ResponseWriter,r *http.Request,actor *Actor,body bsonMap)(any,int,*apiError){id:=asString(body["workerId"]);if actor.ActiveRole!="administrator"&&actor.ActiveRole!="dispatcher"&&id!=actor.UserID{return nil,0,fail(403,"forbidden","Workers may update only their own availability")};cap:=asInt(body["capacityUnits"]);if cap<0{return nil,0,fail(400,"invalid_capacity","Capacity cannot be negative")};res,_:=a.db.Collection("users").UpdateOne(r.Context(),bson.M{"userId":id},bson.M{"$set":bson.M{"available":asBool(body["available"]),"capacityUnits":cap}});if res.MatchedCount==0{return nil,0,fail(404,"not_found","Worker not found")};a.audit(r.Context(),actor,"set_worker_availability","worker",id,true,body);return bson.M{"workerId":id,"available":asBool(body["available"]),"capacityUnits":cap},200,nil}
